      "Senior-living and hospitality are the named growth verticals (VP of Senior Living Mark Pokora, Jan 2025; CPS/CHHSM and Georgia Senior Living Association vendor listings) - unit-turn and renovation work in occupied buildings needs clean, badged finish crews, not just storm labor",
      "Houston is the second hub (ex-Sendero roofing + GC, BBB 'Owner' Ned V. Scott) - a separate conversation about roofing-adjacent exterior and interior rebuild labor in TX"
